a natural and immersive learning experience while maintaining awareness of the surrounding environment.\n\nKey Features\n\n\u2022 Mixed Reality-based CPR training\n\u2022 AED education and emergency response training\n\u2022 Seamless integration of virtual training content with the real environment\n\u2022 Intuitive hand-based interaction\n\u2022 Designed for schools, hospitals, emergency services, and corporate safety training\n\u2022 Repeatable training sessions that enhance learning effectiveness\n\nReaLive MR enhances conventional CPR education by providing a safe, immersive, and highly interactive training environment that helps learners develop practical life-saving skills and emergency response capabilities.\n\nDeveloped by TechSan Co., Ltd., ReaLive MR combines advanced Mixed Reality technology with immersive CPR education to deliver realistic and effective emergency response training.", "short_description": "ReaLive MR is a Mixed Reality CPR training solution that enables immersive CPR and AED education using Meta Quest devices."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\ub85c\uace0_\uc228\ud130\uce58 1024_1024.png", "id": "1592341982239556", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_1592341985572889_6947409751023236525_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ajqhhxd2v6sQ7kNvwHjETHc&_nc_oc=AdoxSVPSHRr8AlyH5Y-ERgJyxhjo98Egaale4zhM2s9G_zpD-UeRNJmOJy6YERqnq_M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJGb-xW37DvsewssqPQ-5429ujskpwwKxVOmiLN2pOyDw&oe=6AA69BFF"}, {"file_name": "\uc228\ud130\uce58_\ub300\ud45c_3000x900_Safe area.png", "id": "1306835034770003", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623384_1306835038103336_6820841876092211466_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p7CwkZOdnjYQ7kNvwHXsLwi&_nc_oc=AdpT1spPj6OjbTuxYkpquScWB-juqWmS9h6Kad9HEkNfNi7npXN9-du3U1GIRneLttU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-